s<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060217223837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Didgeridoo_77a6e3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a didgeridoo.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 42.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When used, there is 10% chance that <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Notes Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Notes_Effect_fb6685.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Green Notes Effect will appear, i.e you will successfully play it, and 90% chance that <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Poof Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poof_Effect_ed1ad3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Poof Effect will appear.<br/>A didgeridoo can be seen in <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>'s <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibian%20Explorer%20Society\">Tibian Explorer Society</a> building.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Although this item was implemented in Summer Update 2005, it became obtainable only after Winter Update 2008 when it was added to <a href=\"#/wiki/Madareth\">Madareth</a>'s loot.<br/>Before the Christmas Update 2009, this item was very rare and expensive, usually owned by collectors. But after this update, it became available to buy from <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a>, lowering the price considerably.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Madareth\">Madareth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">After <a href=\"#/quest/tomes-of-knowledge-quest\">delivering</a> <b>6</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Tome%20of%20Knowledge\">Tomes of Knowledge</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Archdemons</li><li>Bosses</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\